<title>UK: Banco BMG prices $100 mln eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BMG prices $100 mln eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager BankBoston has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BMG</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     9.625     MATURITY    *  JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.89     YIELD	 9.667 PCT</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	+365 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
